  "description": "The PC lens features higher transmittance than other materials,which provides a clearer & brighter lighting so that you can enjoy a pleasant & safe drive.\nFitment\n1988-1993 GMC Chevy C/K 1500 2500 3500\n1988-1993 Chevy Silverado Chevy Suburban\n1988-1993 GMC Sierra GMC Yukon\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: Headlight assembly compatible with 1988 1989 1990 1991 1992 1993 GMC Chevy C/K 1500 2500 3500, 1988-1993 Chevy Silverado Chevy Suburban, 1988-1993 GMC Sierra GMC Yukon; high beam bulb type: HB3; low beam bulb type: HB4; bulbs are not included\nWaterproof Design: Fully sealed with solid silicon & designed with one-way vents to prevent moisture from being trapped inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries in sorts of weather conditions\nBrighter & Safer: Lights minimize obnoxious glare during the night; the sided micro-prism reflector makes the oncoming cars or passerby quickly notice you at night, ensuring your driving safety and others'\nImpact Resistance: The polycarbonate lens & tough housing are highly resistant to shock, vibration for any tough road\nEasy to Install: No modification, no cutting, or no drilling needed. The headlight assembly looks and functions like the stock headlights; professional installation would be highly recommended",
